(text "Si1555DL is a COMPLEMENTARY N+P pair (Vishay 71079): only the N half (unit A, pins S1/G1/D1 = 1/2/6) is used; the P half (unit B, pins 3/4/5) is tied to GND in the strip at right - one package per MOSFET, 8 per channel." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ab7f14f7-34af-4bbf-8fde-a988ac7347b8"))
(text "Values = bfdac_cosim112.cir (bom 3). Re 35.3 -> 35.7 E96 (TNPW0603 0.1 %, Susumu 0.05 % starts at 47 R), Rsh 156.25 -> 156 E96 (RG1608N 0.05 %); Rpad = 2 x 574 in parallel (287). Footprints/MPNs: parts pass 2026-09-28 (MPN field)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 21.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c36ce2b2-dd5b-4112-887f-70b9578e641c"))
